  parallelize across timesteps) — ~13,600 sequential UNet calls per (model, guidance
  scale) run, measured at ~1245s each with `torch.compile` deliberately disabled (avoids
  6 separate compilation passes for 6 short-lived process launches). Ran with
  `--no-compile` across all 6 (model, guidance-scale) combinations, split 3-and-3 across
