- **Headline finding, and it revises the earlier smoke-test conclusion**: with corrected,
  in-distribution targets, k only clearly matters for **digit** (CC 0.26-0.30 at k=1 up to
  0.73-0.80 at k=11, monotonic across both guidance scales). Thickness and intensity
  control are roughly **flat** across k=1/5/11 (differences within noise), not the clean
