  everywhere (CC 0.006-0.094) and mildly **favors k=1** over k=5/k=11 — the opposite
  direction from digit. Higher guidance scale (8 vs 5) improves CC almost everywhere,
  most sharply for digit, at a small FC cost (the expected CFG tradeoff).

